{"name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex 3", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The genial Italian inventor is back with new logical puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the Cryptex by solving the riddles drawn in a book, it seems easy, but you need to use all your brain skills to escape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 3</strong> is a brainteasing game with 50 unique hand-drawn puzzles. The more you crack them, the harder they become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/2d62d122eed8f1605d698908d3a38746.avif?t=1785763801\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/2d62d122eed8f1605d698908d3a38746.avif?t=1785763801\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- 50 new unique enigmas that will put your brain to work</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- A new room you're trapped in </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Captivating background music</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a fan of puzzles, word games, brain thinking, mind games, IQ logic riddles, and enigmas, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> is the game for you, have fun in your spare time!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785763801\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785763801\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Take a challenge again and crack 50 new amazing puzzles in the third chapter of The Da Vinci Cryptex! series!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/e1c280842fe4eae9698a20e94536d3e9b87fc5c0/header.jpg?t=1785763801", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Strategy", "Board Game", "Point & Click", "Puzzle", "Hidden Object"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "release_date": "Dec 27, 2023", "price": "$3.99", "appid": "2729220", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/MvqZJ7qgNHo", "first_seen": 1746835200.0, "review_rank": 1677}